'' RUN: the emitter's spill path (codegen/irsink.ti) builds the program the in-memory path
'' builds. TKO_IR_SPILL=1 spills at every top-level boundary, so the head -- the intrinsic
'' and libm declarations -- is chosen from calls that were already on disk.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ir-spill.bas -o tests/codegen/irspill.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TKO_IR_SPILL=1
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/irspill.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/irspill.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: spilled  4  2  9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 0.546
